  "title_de": "Stimmt das?",
  "title_en": "Is That Correct?",
  "topic": "checking a contact detail at reception",
  "communicative_goal": "Check a contact detail and confirm or correct it with yes or no.",
  "grammar_focus": "yes/no question order with sein and short confirmation responses",
  "supporting_structures": [
    "Ist die Nummer … richtig?",
    "Nein, die letzte Zahl ist falsch.",
    "ihre Telefonnummer",
    "ihren Namen buchstabieren"
  ],
  "grammar_notes": [
    "A yes/no question puts the finite verb Ist before the subject phrase die Nummer.",
    "Im contracts in + dem; the course is a fixed location, so the phrase is dative.",
    "Ihre and ihren are possessive determiners. Their forms agree with the following feminine accusative Telefonnummer and masculine accusative Namen.",
    "Letzte is an attributive adjective with the weak feminine nominative ending after die; richtig and falsch are predicate adjectives and do not decline."
  ],
